|               |   Projection: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER.C_NAME, snowflake.TPCH_SF1.CUSTOMER.C_CUSTKEY, snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERKEY, snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_ORDERDATE, snowflake.TPCH_SF1.ORDERS.O_TOTALPRICE, sum(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_QUANTITY)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
