|               |         TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM projection=[L_ORDERKEY, L_QUANTITY]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
